# Shell scripts are run by the Linux runners of GitHub Actions, so they must be checked out with
# LF endings whatever the platform of the contributor: a CR would reach the shell as part of a
# word -- "do\r" is not "do" -- and the script would fail in CI only, never locally.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Normalise the other text files, and leave anything else to the detection of git.
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.md text
